{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Re-throw `ThreadDeath` on the supported Java 17 runtime.** The SDK targets Java 17, where `Thread.stop()` can still inject `ThreadDeath`; swallowing it here lets a stopped factory or hook thread continue after stack unwinding may have broken invariants. Treat `ThreadDeath` as fatal alongside `VirtualMachineError`, update the contradictory Javadoc, and add factory/hook regression tests that throw it directly.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7xDmy9","finding_digest":"7e3790cdee0d7c8a300f777309edfcee797a00eb9548b03bd52de77fecb27cfe","finding_id":"arf_v1_py3zbtpobv6iumapo5zqt3p45z","finding_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::dispatch::non-vm-error-isolation","identity_key":"sdk/pluginrunner::dispatch::non-vm-error-isolation","line":147,"observation_digest":"9910de3cea1477270c630ba56a0bc0a7d8960a85441a23eb388f491202490f05","observation_id":"aro_v1_tein4phkcr3sodddboswuc6au7","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_py3zbtpobv6iumapo5zqt3p45z","published_at":"2026-09-18T06:10:25Z","review_id":"arr_v1_x3nhz6gqi5fq22rnfi3x2nsf76","reviewed_base_sha":"dd19d8efc275c4cf97e34338fff51f53957e42c6","reviewed_head_sha":"942505504da01e7cf3c786cd615e9f125bfd380c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":147,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_dvxdywb63sgobuqivnvbelcorl","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-18T06:10:25Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
